WEBVTT

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:18.210
There it is.

00:00:32.730 --> 00:00:37.020
Whenever I see tulips, I'm always reminded...

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:46.270
of when we learned that these precious little flowers...

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:51.350
have the strength to endure harsh winters.

00:02:31.340 --> 00:02:32.870
I don't have any chopsticks.

00:02:35.430 --> 00:02:37.830
Your mom must've forgotten them.

00:02:37.830 --> 00:02:40.730
I can't eat without chopsticks.

00:02:40.730 --> 00:02:42.230
Don't you have any spares?

00:02:42.440 --> 00:02:44.290
We're not talking about umbrellas here.

00:02:44.290 --> 00:02:46.370
Maybe you can use something else.

00:02:46.370 --> 00:02:47.200
How about using mechanical pencils?

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:48.860
I can't eat with those!

00:02:48.860 --> 00:02:52.330
Why don't you share with Yuta, then? 
Alternate bites.

00:02:53.140 --> 00:02:54.380
What?

00:02:54.860 --> 00:02:57.370
Why don't you borrow some 
from the cafeteria?

00:02:57.650 --> 00:02:59.650
Even though I'm not eating there?

00:02:59.650 --> 00:03:01.380
What are you going to do, then?

00:03:08.360 --> 00:03:10.470
I'm hungry...

00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:13.610
They're taking so long.

00:03:18.150 --> 00:03:21.480
Maybe there's a long line 
at the vending machine.

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:32.920
Is she a first year?

00:03:33.330 --> 00:03:34.440
She's tiny.

00:03:45.290 --> 00:03:46.280
Excuse me...

00:03:48.480 --> 00:03:51.000
If you'd like, you can use this.

00:03:55.430 --> 00:03:56.810
I don't need your help!

00:04:03.950 --> 00:04:05.480
Hey, wait!

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:09.430
Please stop!

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:20.480
Um, here...

00:04:22.720 --> 00:04:25.450
You really should use this.

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:34.960
Now I'm even hungrier.

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:42.960
You're already eating!

00:04:42.960 --> 00:04:45.100
Well, you disappeared.

00:04:45.440 --> 00:04:47.220
We couldn't wait.

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:52.270
You're all awful. I waited for 
you guys without eating a bite!

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:55.280
We got sidetracked, 
and I was famished.

00:04:55.280 --> 00:04:55.970
Huh?

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:58.600
Kaname forgot his chopsticks.

00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:01.440
He ended up going to the faculty 
office to get some disposable ones.

00:05:02.220 --> 00:05:04.790
If you're going to blame 
anyone, blame him.

00:05:04.790 --> 00:05:06.990
You're placing all the blame on me?

00:05:10.530 --> 00:05:12.530
Shun, your hamburger looks good.

00:05:12.890 --> 00:05:14.250
Give me some.

00:05:14.550 --> 00:05:15.690
No!

00:05:15.690 --> 00:05:17.350
He said no.

00:05:17.350 --> 00:05:20.010
His cheeks look just like hamburgers...

00:05:20.010 --> 00:05:22.090
You set Shun off.

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:23.460
Give him something.

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:24.800
Otherwise he'll never calm down.

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:30.890
Fine.

00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:32.800
That's mine!

00:05:54.310 --> 00:05:56.390
Kaname, is something wrong?

00:05:56.390 --> 00:05:59.520
There was a toothpick 
in with my chopsticks...

00:06:00.330 --> 00:06:02.220
I have some band-aids.

00:06:02.220 --> 00:06:03.750
No, I'm fine.

00:06:04.020 --> 00:06:07.130
Then how about a magical spell 
to make the pain go away.

00:06:07.320 --> 00:06:11.040
Look who's talking. You guys used to...

00:06:11.720 --> 00:06:14.130
Teacher, Yuki tripped.

00:06:14.130 --> 00:06:15.110
It hurts.

00:06:15.110 --> 00:06:18.270
Hold on, don't cry.

00:06:18.760 --> 00:06:21.840
I've got just the spell for you.

00:06:22.220 --> 00:06:25.500
Hurt and pain, hurt and pain...

00:06:25.500 --> 00:06:27.530
Fly away!

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:30.620
It doesn't hurt any more.

00:06:30.620 --> 00:06:33.520
It's just like magic. That's amazing.

00:06:37.210 --> 00:06:39.450
Are you sure I don't need a band-aid?

00:06:39.450 --> 00:06:40.040
Right...

00:06:40.560 --> 00:06:43.500
There's a lot to watch 
out for in this world...

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:45.690
You remember anything that has to do...

00:06:45.690 --> 00:06:47.670
with Kaori-sensei, don't you?

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:48.840
Shut up!

00:06:54.930 --> 00:06:56.930
<b>"Fortune"</b>

00:06:57.530 --> 00:06:59.210
What's wrong, Shun?

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:03.250
There's something in my shoe locker.

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:04.060
Huh?

00:07:04.320 --> 00:07:05.860
What is it?

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:07.530
Could it be your first love letter?

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:10.350
No, it's a fortune...

00:07:10.350 --> 00:07:13.360
A fortune? Lame.

00:07:13.360 --> 00:07:14.860
Why don't you open it?

00:07:15.730 --> 00:07:16.610
Okay.

00:07:17.930 --> 00:07:19.460
Super unlucky?!

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:25.010
It's clearly handwritten.

00:07:25.010 --> 00:07:27.360
You shouldn't take it seriously.

00:07:27.360 --> 00:07:31.340
Could this be the new "bad luck" chain letter?

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:34.600
Kaname-kun, it says that everything 
will be terrible.

00:07:36.030 --> 00:07:37.090
Don't let it bother you.

00:07:37.090 --> 00:07:41.630
You'd have to be stupid to let 
this childish prank get to you.

00:07:41.900 --> 00:07:46.050
Besides, we don't have 
any idea who did it.

00:07:50.680 --> 00:07:51.720
That girl?

00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:16.470
I've always wanted to read this.

00:08:18.820 --> 00:08:21.890
Ow, my butt...

00:08:26.510 --> 00:08:28.300
What does she want?

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:33.860
Shun?

00:08:35.420 --> 00:08:36.310
Shun?

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:42.970
This isn't what it looks like!

00:08:42.970 --> 00:08:44.350
These aren't mine!

00:08:44.850 --> 00:08:46.430
Don't look!

00:08:46.430 --> 00:08:48.750
Hey! Quiet in the library!

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:56.140
<b>"Peach Yogurt"</b>

00:09:04.360 --> 00:09:07.810
Huh? I thought you didn't like coffee, Shun.

00:09:08.350 --> 00:09:10.570
What bad luck, indeed.

00:09:11.190 --> 00:09:14.210
This has been going on for three days now.

00:09:15.010 --> 00:09:16.950
When I was drinking water today,

00:09:19.100 --> 00:09:21.490
she twisted the faucet.

00:09:21.980 --> 00:09:24.170
What did I do to her?

00:09:24.550 --> 00:09:27.130
She's a first year, isn't she?

00:09:27.130 --> 00:09:28.800
I'm impressed she doesn't...

00:09:28.800 --> 00:09:32.960
have any trouble harassing 
an upperclassman like that.

00:09:33.570 --> 00:09:35.030
She'll probably come after you again.

00:09:35.030 --> 00:09:36.090
Be careful.

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:37.970
Okay.

00:09:44.580 --> 00:09:45.760
Kaname-kun!

00:09:46.700 --> 00:09:49.060
Speak of the devil...

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:52.630
It's okay, Shun. It's an obvious trap.

00:09:52.630 --> 00:09:53.390
What?

00:09:53.390 --> 00:10:00.620
It's probably a trap meant to trip you.

00:10:01.320 --> 00:10:03.890
Kaname-kun, it's dangerous!

00:10:07.350 --> 00:10:10.540
Shun, pull this string 
as hard as you can!

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:11.440
What?

00:10:11.440 --> 00:10:13.640
We're gonna drag the culprit out here!

00:10:13.640 --> 00:10:14.480
Come on!

00:10:16.250 --> 00:10:18.130
Why is this happening?

00:10:18.490 --> 00:10:20.510
Ready and...

00:10:22.710 --> 00:10:25.920
Wh-What should we do?

00:10:26.410 --> 00:10:29.620
Calm down! It's just a mannequin!

00:10:30.280 --> 00:10:31.610
A mannequin?

00:10:32.040 --> 00:10:33.550
Oh, you're right.

00:10:34.630 --> 00:10:35.650
Damn it.

00:10:37.140 --> 00:10:37.980
Stop!

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:45.210
What are you doing?!

00:10:45.210 --> 00:10:46.870
Well, um...

00:10:49.820 --> 00:10:51.800
What bad luck.

00:10:54.150 --> 00:10:57.280
Such terrible luck.

00:10:58.360 --> 00:11:02.480
Don't laugh! This isn't funny.

00:11:02.480 --> 00:11:06.900
Why do I have to be the victim 
of this first year's pranks?

00:11:06.900 --> 00:11:09.230
Kaname-kun! Yuki-kun!

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:12.430
He's here!

00:11:12.430 --> 00:11:14.670
Don't come over here.

00:11:14.670 --> 00:11:17.690
Nothing good will come from 
hanging out with you right now.

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:18.930
Don't say that.

00:11:22.190 --> 00:11:23.440
It's her!

00:11:24.390 --> 00:11:25.450
Grab her, Yuki!

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:27.560
Why me?

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:30.150
And don't order me around.

00:11:30.150 --> 00:11:31.490
It's for Shun.

00:11:31.490 --> 00:11:32.960
I'll buy you some manga later!

00:11:38.570 --> 00:11:40.220
He sure is fast.

00:11:40.790 --> 00:11:47.980
I'm not sure if he acted for my 
sake or for the manga, though...

00:12:11.170 --> 00:12:14.330
My, my. What bad luck.

00:12:14.610 --> 00:12:18.650
Could be bad luck, could be good luck...

00:12:19.180 --> 00:12:20.560
It's gotta be bad luck...

00:12:21.350 --> 00:12:24.300
if you accidentally walked 
in on third years changing.

00:12:28.540 --> 00:12:32.360
Why are you nauseous?

00:12:32.360 --> 00:12:38.390
The smell of makeup and 
perfume makes Yuki-kun sick.

00:12:44.130 --> 00:12:48.320
I'm sorry you got mixed up in this.

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:50.040
It's fine.

00:12:51.280 --> 00:12:53.660
Three volumes of manga should make up for it.

00:12:55.640 --> 00:12:57.550
He did it for the manga...

00:12:58.240 --> 00:13:02.250
Why does she keep doing 
these things to you?

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:04.500
Shun, did something happen between you two?

00:13:04.860 --> 00:13:06.400
Did something happen?

00:13:07.670 --> 00:13:12.380
Four or five days ago, I saw 
her with a scraped knee...

00:13:12.380 --> 00:13:14.360
and then, I offered her a band-aid...

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:18.720
Your band-aids are kinda weird.

00:13:19.050 --> 00:13:21.300
Maybe she didn't like the design.

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:24.480
They're cute!

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:27.470
Let's go. Class is starting.

00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:41.550
Do you wanna go somewhere 
on the way home?

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:43.670
I want veggie ice cream.

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:44.880
No chance.

00:13:44.880 --> 00:13:48.070
Last time, you got garlic-liver last time didn't eat it 
 so I had to finish it!

00:13:48.070 --> 00:13:49.500
Sardine-flavor was delicious, though.

00:13:49.530 --> 00:13:50.550
No way!

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:52.510
That's her.

00:14:01.390 --> 00:14:02.660
Are you okay?

00:14:02.660 --> 00:14:04.200
You can't do that by yourself.

00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:09.710
Let's go.

00:14:09.710 --> 00:14:10.620
Okay.

00:14:11.520 --> 00:14:12.920
I see.

00:14:13.270 --> 00:14:15.520
I bet she doesn't like having people...

00:14:15.520 --> 00:14:18.790
help her or worry about her.

00:14:22.040 --> 00:14:26.090
She gets angry when 
people try to help her.

00:14:26.640 --> 00:14:28.430
So they know she's fine on her own.

00:14:49.290 --> 00:14:50.790
You're too defenseless.

00:14:51.130 --> 00:14:52.240
Yuta-kun.

00:14:53.360 --> 00:14:55.230
Yuki and Kaname are looking for you.

00:14:55.730 --> 00:14:57.500
They're going to the 
bookstore after school.

00:14:58.010 --> 00:15:00.750
Oh, that sounds good.

00:15:01.440 --> 00:15:02.530
What were you doing?

00:15:02.990 --> 00:15:04.880
I was looking at the tulips.

00:15:05.390 --> 00:15:10.260
When I was little, I didn't know 
tulips could survive through winter.

00:15:10.700 --> 00:15:13.830
One time, I frantically removed the snow...

00:15:13.830 --> 00:15:16.460
covering the tulip pots in kindergarten.

00:15:35.730 --> 00:15:37.680
Shun, what are you doing?

00:15:38.090 --> 00:15:39.820
It's an emergency!

00:15:39.820 --> 00:15:42.960
The tulips are filled with snow.

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:46.790
It'll be too cold for them to bloom.

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:49.690
I need to get the snow off...

00:15:50.830 --> 00:15:52.380
Hey, Shun.

00:15:53.430 --> 00:15:56.470
Tulips are surprisingly tough.

00:15:56.970 --> 00:16:00.990
They'll sprout once the snow 
melts even if you don't do that.

00:16:00.990 --> 00:16:03.400
What? Really?

00:16:04.740 --> 00:16:05.840
Really?

00:16:05.840 --> 00:16:10.800
Th- then these tulips will bloom in the spring?

00:16:10.800 --> 00:16:11.780
Yeah.

00:16:11.990 --> 00:16:15.000
I see. That's great.

00:16:17.820 --> 00:16:19.360
I had spent so much time digging...

00:16:19.360 --> 00:16:21.440
through the snow without gloves on,

00:16:21.440 --> 00:16:23.830
my hands were so frostbitten.

00:16:25.230 --> 00:16:29.540
They felt so itchy and 
hot. They were on fire.

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:34.690
I wanted to stick my 
hands back in the snow.

00:16:36.890 --> 00:16:38.110
I remember.

00:16:39.750 --> 00:16:43.230
Those tulips bloomed.

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:47.610
Yes.

00:16:47.610 --> 00:16:50.860
"Yuki Asaba" "Yuta Asaba"

00:16:50.860 --> 00:16:53.860
"Kaname Tsukahara"

00:16:53.860 --> 00:16:56.870
"Shun Matsuoka"

00:16:56.870 --> 00:17:00.870
"Yuki Asaba" "Yuta Asaba" "Kanama 
Tsukahara" "Shun Matsuoka"

00:17:05.650 --> 00:17:08.550
Even without freezing my hands...

00:17:08.550 --> 00:17:12.580
everyone's tulips would have 
blossomed beautifully.

00:17:13.930 --> 00:17:15.830
There they are.

00:17:16.910 --> 00:17:18.640
Let's go to the bookstore.

00:17:18.800 --> 00:17:20.360
Okay.

00:17:20.360 --> 00:17:21.290
I...

00:17:26.210 --> 00:17:28.630
Yuta-kun, are you okay?

00:17:28.630 --> 00:17:30.150
Yeah, surprisingly.

00:17:32.070 --> 00:17:33.250
A rock...

00:17:33.250 --> 00:17:34.150
Could it be?

00:17:38.110 --> 00:17:41.850
Yu-Yu-Yuta-kun, you're bleeding!

00:17:43.060 --> 00:17:45.160
Yeah, a little.

00:17:45.160 --> 00:17:47.920
That's a lot!

00:17:51.990 --> 00:17:52.990
Shun!

00:18:20.310 --> 00:18:22.480
Who are you mad at?

00:18:22.940 --> 00:18:23.910
Isn't it me?

00:18:25.610 --> 00:18:29.170
So don't involve people who have 
nothing to do with this!

00:18:30.080 --> 00:18:31.670
I won't allow it!

00:18:40.860 --> 00:18:44.230
I'm sorry, all right?! I didn't mean to hit him.

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:46.650
I just meant to scare you!

00:18:48.050 --> 00:18:50.100
This is all your fault!

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:52.300
Why'd you have to chase me back then?

00:18:52.300 --> 00:18:54.540
I don't need your help.

00:18:54.600 --> 00:18:57.090
It makes me so angry.

00:18:57.090 --> 00:18:59.130
Did you think I'd be grateful?

00:19:01.050 --> 00:19:02.880
I can manage on my own.

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:04.950
Don't mock me!

00:19:05.610 --> 00:19:07.310
I didn't mean...

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:18.970
What are you doing?

00:19:18.970 --> 00:19:21.430
I just wanted to make sure.

00:19:21.430 --> 00:19:22.210
What?

00:19:22.210 --> 00:19:24.030
Are you okay?

00:19:24.090 --> 00:19:25.430
I'm sorry!

00:19:25.430 --> 00:19:27.930
It still hasn't healed yet?

00:19:30.040 --> 00:19:32.340
How long are you going 
to keep that band-aid on?

00:19:36.720 --> 00:19:39.490
Are you sure you weren't 
actually happy?

00:19:56.720 --> 00:19:59.940
B-But...

00:20:01.670 --> 00:20:03.900
I just get so angry.

00:20:05.120 --> 00:20:08.530
You should've just ignored me...

00:20:09.400 --> 00:20:11.790
like people usually do.

00:20:13.390 --> 00:20:15.060
But I was so happy.

00:20:16.220 --> 00:20:17.620
So happy.

00:20:24.690 --> 00:20:25.740
Why?

00:20:34.410 --> 00:20:39.500
But I'm not the only one he'd chase.

00:20:47.830 --> 00:20:55.860
I... didn't think I was bothering you.

00:20:57.040 --> 00:20:58.710
I guess I overstepped my bounds.

00:20:59.190 --> 00:21:00.280
I'm sorry.

00:21:02.100 --> 00:21:05.050
N-N-No...

00:21:05.050 --> 00:21:08.750
But I might chase you again.

00:21:09.820 --> 00:21:11.700
I've still got some bandaids.

00:21:14.780 --> 00:21:15.920
Um...

00:21:15.920 --> 00:21:19.010
What's your name?

00:21:19.870 --> 00:21:23.360
It was hard to tell you to stop 
 without your name...

00:21:24.820 --> 00:21:26.720
Oh, you don't have to...

00:21:27.200 --> 00:21:28.960
Masaki Sato.

00:21:29.440 --> 00:21:32.370
G-Give me another band-aid sometime.

00:21:32.820 --> 00:21:35.190
The design's cute.

00:21:42.160 --> 00:21:46.290
What were the past few days about?

00:21:46.290 --> 00:21:49.250
I ended up getting lectured.

00:21:49.800 --> 00:21:51.540
You're still bitter about that?

00:21:51.540 --> 00:21:52.950
Well, because...

00:21:52.950 --> 00:21:54.060
Isn't that right, Yuta?

00:21:57.790 --> 00:22:00.740
I've got a bunch of other cute ones.

00:22:00.740 --> 00:22:02.210
R-Really?

00:22:06.660 --> 00:22:09.040
If you understand then let's go inside.

00:22:09.040 --> 00:22:10.470
Okay.

00:22:12.230 --> 00:22:15.270
It's freezing! You're not wearing any gloves!

00:22:15.270 --> 00:22:17.320
I was in a rush...

00:22:20.350 --> 00:22:21.550
It's okay.

00:22:22.090 --> 00:22:25.780
Your feelings weren't for nothing.

00:22:39.880 --> 00:22:44.920
"The Day the Tulips Bloomed"

00:24:15.890 --> 00:24:19.630
"The Straw-Colored Boy"

00:24:15.890 --> 00:24:19.630
Next time: The Straw-Colored Boy
